<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:#f5f7f5;padding:24px;" width="100%">
	
		<tr>
			<td align="center">
			<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:620px;max-width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e6e2;" width="620"><!-- HEADER -->
				
					<tr>
						<td bgcolor="#2f4233" style="background-color:#2f4233;padding:22px 28px;">
						<div style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#cbd8ce;font-weight:bold;">AI AGENT GOVERNANCE</div>

						<div style="font-size:22px;line-height:28px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;padding-top:4px;">Security Assessment Required</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<!-- INTRO -->
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:26px 28px 14px 28px;color:#242424;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">Hello,<br />
						<br />
						The AI Agent <strong>{{{AI_Agent__c.Name}}}</strong> has been created or updated with <strong>Critical Business Criticality</strong>.<br />
						<br />
						Your security review and validation are required as part of the Carmignac AI Agent Governance process.</td>
					</tr>
					<!-- DETAILS -->
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:6px 28px 22px 28px;">
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="font-size:14px;color:#242424;" width="100%">
							
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;" width="180">Agent</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;">{{{AI_Agent__c.Name}}}</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;">Agent Purpose</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;line-height:20px;">{{{AI_Agent__c.AgentPurpose__c}}}</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Business Criticality</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;"><strong>{{{AI_Agent__c.Business_Criticality__c}}}</strong></td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Data Sensitivity</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;">{{{AI_Agent__c.DataSensitivity__c}}}</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Client Impact</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;">{{{AI_Agent__c.ClientImpact__c}}}</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Current Risk Level</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;"><strong>{{{AI_Agent__c.CurrentRiskLevel__c}}}</strong></td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<!-- ACTION REQUIRED -->
					<tr>
						<td bgcolor="#f1f5f2" style="background-color:#f1f5f2;padding:20px 28px;color:#242424;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;"><strong style="color:#2f4233;font-size:15px;">Action required – Security assessment </strong><br />
						<br />
						Please review the Agent configuration and confirm:
						<ul style="margin:8px 0 8px 20px;padding:0;">
							<li style="margin-bottom:6px;">whether the proposed architecture, access and usage are acceptable from a security perspective;</li>
							<li style="margin-bottom:6px;">whether additional security controls or mitigations are required;</li>
							<li style="margin-bottom:6px;">whether the Agent may support or impact a DORA Critical or Important Function and requires further assessment;</li>
							<li>your validation and any required next steps before the Agent can proceed.</li>
						</ul>
						<br />
						<strong>Please reply to this email with your assessment, validation and any required next steps. </strong></td>
					</tr>
					<!-- CTA -->
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:24px 28px 28px 28px;">
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation">
							
								<tr>
									<td bgcolor="#2f4233" style="background-color:#2f4233;padding:12px 20px;"><a href="{{{AI_Agent__c.Link}}}" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;">Open AI Agent </a></td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<!-- FOOTER -->
					<tr>
						<td style="border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;padding:16px 28px;color:#777777;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;">This is an automated governance escalation notification.<br />
						<br />
						For any questions, contact <strong>dust@carmignac.com</strong>.<br />
						<br />
						Dust Admin Team<br />
						Carmignac AI Agent Governance</td>
					</tr>
				
			</table>
			</td>
		</tr>
	
</table>
</body>
</html>